{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-truth-phone-tracker-services-2-a-01","date":"2026-11-25","lens":"2","surface":"phone","area":"phone/tracker-services-2","refs":["F-phone-119","F-phone-635"],"severity":"S3","title":"The AI coach can delete a saved workout with no on-screen check and no undo","what":"The coach chat has a 'delete a workout' action. The app itself never asks the member to confirm: only the AI's own instructions say to ask first. It deletes by day alone, and when two workouts are on that day it deletes the newest one. A misread message or a wrong day from the AI removes a real workout and its records for good. The coach chat is switched off today, so this waits for the day it is turned on.","expected":"Before any workout is deleted from the chat, the app shows the exact workout (day, name, sets) and asks the member to confirm on screen, or offers Undo, exactly like the delete on the saved workout page.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/ai/tools.ts:1348-1384","apps/mobile/src/tracker/services/prRebuild.ts:186-198","apps/mobile/src/tracker/services/workoutDelete.ts:55-71"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"ai-delete-without-app-confirm","who":"members using the AI coach","how_often":"only once the coach chat is switched on; each time the AI decides to delete","fix_line":"Make the app, not the AI, ask the member to confirm the exact workout before deleting it","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-truth-phone-tracker-services-2-a-02","date":"2026-11-25","lens":"2","surface":"phone","area":"phone/tracker-services-2","refs":["F-phone-607"],"severity":"S4","title":"A one-time records repair can skip its second half for good if the app closes mid-way","what":"An older version over-counted single-rep sets as records. A one-time repair first corrects those rows, then re-records sets the old number had hidden. The two steps are not done together: if the app is closed between them, the next start finds nothing left to correct, marks the repair done, and the hidden records are never added.","expected":"The correction and the re-recording happen together, or the repair is marked done only after both, so a closed app simply retries.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/tracker/services/prRebuild.ts:99-110"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"record-repair-not-one-step","who":"members upgrading from an old version","how_often":"rare: only if the app closes in that moment","fix_line":"Do the row fix and the re-record in one step, like the other two repairs","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
